    <briefdescription>
<para>A smart pointer to a reference-counted object that inherits from <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_ref_counted_base" kindref="compound">RefCountedBase</ref> or <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_thread_safe_ref_counted_base" kindref="compound">ThreadSafeRefCountedBase</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class increments its pointee&apos;s reference count when it is created, and decrements its refcount when it&apos;s destroyed (or is changed to point to a different object). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
